@startuml Linkwise_Modem_Runtime
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam Padding 8
skinparam defaultFontName "Latin Modern Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam ArrowColor #2A9D8F
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 20
skinparam ranksep 25
top to bottom direction
rectangle "ChatGPT Agent / Codex\noptional strategic orchestration" as AI
rectangle "MCP inbound adapter\nmanagement / observations" as MCP
rectangle "Traditional client\nExpress / Pat" as Client
rectangle "Host TCP adapter\nexclusive socket pair\ncommands + binary DATA" as Host
rectangle "Station execution service\nstandalone / managed admission\npolicy / lease / operation" as Station
AI -right-> MCP
Client -right-> Host
MCP --> Station : prepare / arm reservation
Host --> Station : CONNECT / attach / channel loss
rectangle "ModemSessionPort\nbackend lifecycle interface" as Port
rectangle "PTT arbiter + watchdog\nsole software key-up path" as PTT
Station --> Port : bounded lifecycle
Station --> PTT : session authority
package "Backend adapters -- proposed interchangeability" {
 rectangle "Native Rust adapter\none session actor\nphase / tokens / timers\nbyte accounting" as Native
 rectangle "External VARA adapter\nrelease-qualified interface" as Vara
 rectangle "Simulator adapter\nsame domain contract" as Sim
}
Port <|.. Native
Port <|.. Vara
Port <|.. Sim
Host ..> Native : host::ModemPort data/events\nbound to admitted owner
rectangle "Audio execution adapter\ncapture / presentation\ncancellation / epochs\nsimulation before native OS" as Audio
Native ..> Audio : bounded execution
Native ..> PTT : permitted keying / release
package "Native components -- implemented prototypes" {
 rectangle "Capture + receive worker\nacquisition / FEC / CRC" as RX
 rectangle "AudioHandshake\nphased audio exchange" as HS
 rectangle "DATA codec + ARQ sender\nwire integration pending" as Link
 RX -[hidden]right-> HS
 HS -[hidden]right-> Link
}
Native ..> RX : assemble
Native ..> HS : assemble
Native ..> Link : assemble
note bottom of Link
 Dotted native integration remains proposed.
 Shared runtime first; OS packaging follows.
 Traditional-client bytes stay outside MCP.
end note
@enduml
